done incorrectly please let me know. If you want to re-use this image you need to attribute/license the author as well (details available in the original source).</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Image source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vantablack_02.JPG">Vantablack</a><br /> <strong>Original name:</strong> Vantablack 02<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC 3.0<br /> <strong>Original by:</strong> Surrey NanoSystems 20 June 2014, 13:17:33</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Image source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vegetarian_caviar_from_algae_%27Laminaria_hyperborea%27_(on_plate).jpg">Caviar</a><br /> <strong>Original name:</strong> Vegetarian caviar from algae 'Laminaria hyperborea' (on plate)<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC 3.0<br /> <strong>Original by:</strong> FakirNL 30 November 2013</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Image source:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/41894170049@N01/2178110124">Purple appendages</a><br /> <strong>Original name:</strong> Light painting<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC 2.0<br /> <strong>Original by:</strong> Andrew Malone 22 December 2007<br /> <strong>Additional note:</strong> I edited the original picture (added noise and added text on the image)</p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608128226" alt="Sirslash47" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" >Sirslash47</a></span></p> 
